{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "03177",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.07,
      "end_seconds": 4.8,
      "duration_seconds": 3.73,
      "text": "Hello? Doctor? I was told to come in."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.3,
      "end_seconds": 10.33,
      "duration_seconds": 4.03,
      "text": "Of course, leave it there. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.14,
      "end_seconds": 14.74,
      "duration_seconds": 3.6,
      "text": "I've been dealing with shoulder tip pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 18.05,
      "end_seconds": 21.02,
      "duration_seconds": 2.97,
      "text": "How long has this been bothering you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 22.27,
      "end_seconds": 25.91,
      "duration_seconds": 3.64,
      "text": "It's been going on for three weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 27.42,
      "end_seconds": 30.54,
      "duration_seconds": 3.12,
      "text": "Is it a lot or only a little?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 31.55,
      "end_seconds": 33.28,
      "duration_seconds": 1.73,
      "text": "Mild, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 34.72,
      "end_seconds": 37.41,
      "duration_seconds": 2.69,
      "text": "Is there anything else with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 39.4,
      "end_seconds": 56.0,
      "duration_seconds": 16.6,
      "text": "When it starts I tend to get sudden severe pain in the lower tummy as well. As for collapsing, I honestly can't say when that began. It might have been last month or the month before."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 57.68,
      "end_seconds": 61.54,
      "duration_seconds": 3.86,
      "text": "So, is it bearing on you a lot?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 63.5,
      "end_seconds": 81.94,
      "duration_seconds": 18.44,
      "text": "Maybe a six out of ten on a bad day. Uh, the sudden severe pain in the lower tummy? That's been for about three months. Oh, and vaginal spotting. Had that since last night."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 83.55,
      "end_seconds": 87.32,
      "duration_seconds": 3.77,
      "text": "Okay, have you had any vomiting, discharge or fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 88.61,
      "end_seconds": 93.25,
      "duration_seconds": 4.64,
      "text": "Right, no vomiting, discharge or fever, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 95.11,
      "end_seconds": 98.47,
      "duration_seconds": 3.36,
      "text": "Anything on the skin I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 99.5,
      "end_seconds": 102.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.62,
      "text": "Nothing on the skin, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 104.21,
      "end_seconds": 108.11,
      "duration_seconds": 3.9,
      "text": "On the cardiac side, anything I should know?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 108.64,
      "end_seconds": 110.95,
      "duration_seconds": 2.31,
      "text": "No, that's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 111.66,
      "end_seconds": 116.01,
      "duration_seconds": 4.35,
      "text": "What conditions have you been treated for in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 117.45,
      "end_seconds": 119.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.23,
      "text": "Yes, an irregular heartbeat."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 124.25,
      "end_seconds": 124.95,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Understood."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 126.95,
      "end_seconds": 134.39,
      "duration_seconds": 7.44,
      "text": "I have an underactive thyroid. Arthritis in my knees, for about ten years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 140.22,
      "end_seconds": 146.16,
      "duration_seconds": 5.94,
      "text": "Alright, an irregular heartbeat and an underactive thyroid, that matches what I have here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 157.73,
      "end_seconds": 160.36,
      "duration_seconds": 2.63,
      "text": "Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 161.0,
      "end_seconds": 162.08,
      "duration_seconds": 1.08,
      "text": "No, never."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 163.95,
      "end_seconds": 168.42,
      "duration_seconds": 4.47,
      "text": "Are you allergic to anything? Any allergies to medicines or foods?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 170.11,
      "end_seconds": 178.16,
      "duration_seconds": 8.05,
      "text": "I had a reaction to amoxicillin when I was younger, hives, and I've avoided it since."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 179.83,
      "end_seconds": 183.84,
      "duration_seconds": 4.01,
      "text": "What about your parents, brothers or sisters, any conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 184.55,
      "end_seconds": 188.66,
      "duration_seconds": 4.11,
      "text": "My grandmother had dementia. My mother had a stroke."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 190.62,
      "end_seconds": 191.82,
      "duration_seconds": 1.2,
      "text": "What about alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 193.18,
      "end_seconds": 195.0,
      "duration_seconds": 1.82,
      "text": "Nothing, I'm teetotal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 197.06,
      "end_seconds": 198.94,
      "duration_seconds": 1.88,
      "text": "Who lives with you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 200.83,
      "end_seconds": 203.66,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "My partner and our baby."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 204.63,
      "end_seconds": 206.72,
      "duration_seconds": 2.09,
      "text": "Tell me about your eating."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 207.41,
      "end_seconds": 213.17,
      "duration_seconds": 5.76,
      "text": "I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 214.6,
      "end_seconds": 218.31,
      "duration_seconds": 3.71,
      "text": "Are you taking anything regularly, including from the pharmacy?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 220.05,
      "end_seconds": 222.36,
      "duration_seconds": 2.31,
      "text": "Metoprolol, twice a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 224.39,
      "end_seconds": 226.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.22,
      "text": "How much do you take?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 227.55,
      "end_seconds": 237.67,
      "duration_seconds": 10.12,
      "text": "50 milligrams, I think that's what's on the box. Thyronorm. I take it 50 micrograms, every morning for my thyroid."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 238.02,
      "end_seconds": 239.11,
      "duration_seconds": 1.09,
      "text": "Right, right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 240.93,
      "end_seconds": 249.84,
      "duration_seconds": 8.91,
      "text": "I take naproxen, 250 milligrams, twice a day. Before this I was on diclofenac; that's been stopped."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 260.77,
      "end_seconds": 273.34,
      "duration_seconds": 12.57,
      "text": "Okay, so the vitals from earlier. Temperature is 36.9 degrees, heart rate 103, blood pressure 102 over 66, height 154 centimetres, weight 65 kilos, BMI works out to 27.4."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 274.34,
      "end_seconds": 275.04,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 277.33,
      "end_seconds": 281.19,
      "duration_seconds": 3.86,
      "text": "Let me look at the area, I'll be gentle."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 283.15,
      "end_seconds": 284.83,
      "duration_seconds": 1.68,
      "text": "Let me feel here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 302.69,
      "end_seconds": 309.4,
      "duration_seconds": 6.71,
      "text": "You are pale and clammy with a rigid, tender tummy and a very low blood pressure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 312.09,
      "end_seconds": 314.55,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "Okay, that's enough for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 332.19,
      "end_seconds": 336.39,
      "duration_seconds": 4.2,
      "text": "We should do urgent blood tests for internal bleeding."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 338.35,
      "end_seconds": 339.56,
      "duration_seconds": 1.21,
      "text": "Right, understood."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 340.29,
      "end_seconds": 344.02,
      "duration_seconds": 3.73,
      "text": "I've already done a pregnancy test, it's ready for you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 345.7,
      "end_seconds": 362.66,
      "duration_seconds": 16.96,
      "text": "Okay, I'll take a look at that. I am calling the emergency team, you need an operation now. The thing that would worry me is if the symptoms get worse. If that happens, go to emergency. Come back straight away."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 364.6,
      "end_seconds": 366.6,
      "duration_seconds": 2.0,
      "text": "That's fine with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 367.88,
      "end_seconds": 373.96,
      "duration_seconds": 6.08,
      "text": "Can you run through the plan with me quickly, just to be certain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 375.46,
      "end_seconds": 380.24,
      "duration_seconds": 4.78,
      "text": "So, I come back straight away. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 381.71,
      "end_seconds": 387.13,
      "duration_seconds": 5.42,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Is there anything you'd like me to go over again?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 388.32,
      "end_seconds": 391.45,
      "duration_seconds": 3.13,
      "text": "I think I understand everything. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 392.77,
      "end_seconds": 393.98,
      "duration_seconds": 1.21,
      "text": "Goodbye for now."
    }
  ]
}